    <values><field>Active__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:boolean">true</value></values><values><field>Advice__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">An AI agent that runs as a user inherits everything that user can see and edit. With Public Read/Write every user, and every agent acting for them, can change every donor record. Set donor objects to Private or Public Read Only and open access with roles or sharing rules.</value></values><values><field>Category__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">ACCESS</value></values><values><field>Check_Type__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Automated</value></values><values><field>Critical__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:boolean">true</value></values><values><field>Handler__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">SharingDefaults</value></values><values><field>Level__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Org</value></values><values><field>Pass_Criteria__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">None of these objects is Public Read/Write (or wider) for internal users. Public Read Only passes with a note.</value></values><values><field>Question__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Checks the organisation-wide sharing default for Account, Contact, Opportunity, Case and Lead.</value></values><values><field>Resources__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Trailhead: Data Security|https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/data_security</value></values><values><field>Sort_Order__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:double">60</value></values><values><field>Topic__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">T2</value></values>
